msgid "Hover Preview"
msgstr "悬停预览"

msgid "Show an enlarged floating preview when hovering over a library thumbnail. It appears with the same delay as a tooltip, and needs Blender tooltips to be enabled"
msgstr "当悬停在库缩略图上时，显示放大的浮动预览。它出现的延迟与工具提示相同，需要启用 Blender 工具提示才能显示。"

msgid "Shader Stats"
msgstr "着色器统计信息"

msgid "Show the MP Stats row in the main panel: expanded node count, texture memory and live vs cached masks for the active material. It is only measured when you press its refresh button, and after Flatten and cache operations to show the before/after"
msgstr "在主面板中显示 MP 统计行：展开的节点数、纹理内存以及活动材质的实时与缓存遮罩。仅在按下刷新按钮后测量，并在执行“展平”和“缓存”操作后显示前后对比。"

msgid "Hover Preview Size"
msgstr "悬停预览大小"

msgid "Size of the enlarged preview, in pixels"
msgstr "放大预览的尺寸，单位为像素"

msgid "Auto-update Effects & Caches (default)"
msgstr "自动更新效果与缓存（默认）"

msgid "Default state of the Auto-update button for new projects. It automatically re-bakes the effects that depend on a change (filters and linkmasks above it in the chain, and the masks that consume those linkmasks) and refreshes the mask caches. Each project can override it from the Layers panel"
msgstr "新建项目的自动更新按钮的默认状态。它会自动重新烘焙受更改影响的效果（链中位于其上方的滤镜和链接遮罩，以及消耗这些链接遮罩的遮罩），并刷新遮罩缓存。每个项目都可以通过图层面板覆盖此设置。"

msgid "Auto-cache New Layers"
msgstr "自动缓存新图层"

msgid "Automatically cache a newly created layer as soon as it gets a mask, instead of pressing the Cache button by hand. Only applies to layers created while this option is enabled. Turning it on from the Layers panel also caches the layers that already exist. It needs Auto-update enabled: without it the cache would freeze on its first bake"
msgstr "自动缓存新创建的图层，只要其获得遮罩就会立即缓存，而无需手动按下“缓存”按钮。此选项仅适用于在此选项启用时创建的图层。从图层面板中开启它也会缓存已存在的图层。需要启用自动更新：否则缓存会在第一次烘焙时冻结"

msgid "Sync Set Material with Viewport Selection"
msgstr "同步材质与视口选择"

msgid "When you select an object in the viewport, activate the MatPlus Set Material that owns it. If the object already belongs to the active Set Material, nothing changes"
msgstr "选择视口中的对象时，激活其所属的 MatPlus 材质集。如果该对象已经属于当前活动的材质集，则不会有任何变化"

msgid "Use Mouse Wheel for Brush Size"
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮调整笔刷大小"

msgid "Toggle between default [ and ] keys or Ctrl + Mouse Wheel for brush size scaling in Image Paint, Weight Paint, and Vertex Paint modes"
msgstr "在图像绘画、权重绘画和顶点绘画模式下，切换默认 [ ] 键或 Ctrl + 鼠标滚轮以缩放笔刷大小"

