msgid "MatPlus Textures"
msgstr "MatPlus 纹理库"

msgid "Directory holding your texture libraries. Each first-level subfolder is a library (for example MatPlusMasks or Brushes And Icons), and inside it each subfolder is a category. A category can hold the images directly, or split them into textures/ and thumbnails/"
msgstr "存放您的纹理库的目录。每个一级子文件夹是一个库（例如 MatPlusMasks 或 Brushes And Icons），而每个子文件夹则是一个类别。一个类别可以直接包含图像，或者将它们分成 textures/和 thumbnails/"

msgid "MatPlus Masks"
msgstr "MatPlus Masks"

msgid "Directory holding your mask library. Each first-level subfolder becomes a category in the galleries (Fill Effect, material channels, intelligent masks). A category can hold the images directly, or split them into textures/ and thumbnails/"
msgstr "存放您的遮罩库的目录。每个一级子文件夹在画廊中成为一个类别（填充效果、材质通道、智能遮罩）。一个类别可以直接包含图像，或者将它们分成 textures/和 thumbnails/"

msgid "Brushes And Icons"
msgstr "Brushes And Icons"

msgid "Directory holding your brushes, icons and decals. Each first-level subfolder becomes a category in the galleries (Decals, Stitch Curves, paint brushes). A category can hold the images directly, or split them into textures/ and thumbnails/"
msgstr "存放您的笔刷、图标和贴纸的目录。每个一级子文件夹在画廊中成为一个类别（贴纸、缝合曲线、画笔）。一个类别可以直接包含图像，或者将它们分成 textures/和 thumbnails/"

