msgid "Resolution of the bevel effect"
msgstr "倒角效果的分辨率"

msgid "Resolution of the blur effect"
msgstr "模糊效果的分辨率"

msgid "Blur Size"
msgstr "模糊大小"

msgid "Base size for blur. Scales according to resolution. (0 = no blur)"
msgstr "模糊的基础尺寸。根据分辨率缩放。（0 = 无模糊）"

msgid "Paint Brush"
msgstr "画笔"

msgid "Eraser Brush"
msgstr "橡皮擦笔刷"

msgid "Clone Brush"
msgstr "克隆笔刷"

msgid "Fill Brush"
msgstr "填充笔刷"

msgid "Resolution of the dripping rust effect"
msgstr "滴落铁锈效果的分辨率"

msgid "Rust Spreading"
msgstr "铁锈扩散"

msgid "How far the rust creeps out from the incoming mask. Near the source it is solid; further out it breaks into specks"
msgstr "铁锈从进入的遮罩向外蔓延的距离。靠近源头时是实心的；越远则破碎成斑点"

msgid "Rust Contrast"
msgstr "铁锈对比度"

msgid "Contrast of the rust specks. High values give hard, well defined flecks; low values a soft wash. Does not affect the drips"
msgstr "锈斑的对比。高值产生清晰、轮廓分明的斑点；低值则呈现柔和的晕染效果。不影响滴落效果。"

msgid "Spreading Smoothness"
msgstr "平滑度扩散"

msgid "Blurs and smears the rust specks once they have been generated"
msgstr "模糊并涂抹生成的锈斑"

msgid "Spread Falloff"
msgstr "衰减范围"

msgid "Shape of the fade from the source outwards. Above 1 keeps the rust tight against the mask and leaves only specks around it; below 1 spreads it evenly"
msgstr "Fade 从源向外扩散的形状。大于 1 会使铁锈紧贴遮罩，仅在周围留下斑点；小于 1 则使其均匀扩散。"

msgid "Speck Size"
msgstr "斑点大小"

msgid "Size of the individual rust flecks"
msgstr "单个铁锈斑点的尺寸"

msgid "Erosion"
msgstr "侵蚀"

msgid "Eats whole patches out of the rust with a coarser noise, so the corrosion is not spread evenly around the mask. It cuts the rust away rather than fading it, so the mask stays clean. The size of the patches follows Speck Size"
msgstr "用更粗糙的噪声从铁锈中吃出整个斑块，因此腐蚀不会均匀地分布在遮罩周围。它切掉铁锈而不是使其褪色，所以遮罩保持干净。斑块的大小遵循斑点大小（Speck Size）。"

msgid "Drips Intensity"
msgstr "滴落强度"

msgid "Strength of the drips running down from the rust"
msgstr "锈水滴落的强度"

msgid "Drips Length"
msgstr "水滴长度"

msgid "How far the drips run, in pixels at 1K (it is rescaled with the effect resolution, so the look does not change at 2K or 4K)"
msgstr "水滴延伸的距离，以 1K 像素为单位（它会随效果分辨率重新缩放，因此 2K 或 4K 下的外观不会改变）"

msgid "Drips Density"
msgstr "水滴密度"

msgid "How many of the rust specks actually drip. Low values leave a few isolated runs, high values a curtain"
msgstr "有多少个锈斑实际上会滴水。低值留下几个孤立的流痕，高值形成一道帘幕"

msgid "Drips Width"
msgstr "水滴宽度"

msgid "Thickness of each individual run"
msgstr "每条独立流痕的粗细"

msgid "Length Variation"
msgstr "长度变化"

msgid "Randomises the length of each run so they do not all stop at the same height"
msgstr "随机化每条流痕的长度，使它们不会在同一高度停止"

msgid "Drips Fade"
msgstr "水滴渐隐"

msgid "How much of the drip survives at its tip. 0 fades out completely, 1 keeps it as strong as where it started"
msgstr "尖端处有多少水滴会存活。0 完全消失，1 保持其初始强度不变。"

msgid "Drips Smoothness"
msgstr "滴落平滑度"

msgid "Blurs and smooths the drips"
msgstr "模糊并平滑水滴"

msgid "Use Position Map"
msgstr "使用位置贴图"

msgid "Take the drip direction from the baked Position map, so the runs fall along real world gravity and die out on surfaces facing up. Without the map (or with this off) the fixed angle below is used"
msgstr "从烘焙的位置图获取滴水方向，使水滴沿真实世界重力下落并在朝上的表面消失。没有该图（或此选项关闭）时，将使用下方的固定角度。"

msgid "Gravity Influence"
msgstr "重力影响"

msgid "How much the real slope shortens the drips. At 1 nothing runs on surfaces facing up; at 0 everything drips the same regardless of how the surface is oriented"
msgstr "实际坡度对滴水的影响有多大。在 1 时，朝上的表面不会滴水；在 0 时，无论表面朝向如何，所有表面都会以相同的方式滴水。"

msgid "Flow Angle"
msgstr "流角度"

msgid "Fallback direction in texture space when no Position map is used. 0 runs straight down the image"
msgstr "当未使用位置贴图时，纹理空间中的回退方向。0 沿图像垂直向下运行"

msgid "Flow Distortion"
msgstr "流动畸变"

msgid "Bends the flow with noise so the runs are not perfectly parallel"
msgstr "使用噪声使流弯曲，使运行不再完全平行"

msgid "Pushes rust onto the sharp edges using the baked Curvature map. Negative values do the opposite and protect them"
msgstr "使用烘焙的曲率图将锈推向尖锐边缘。负值则做相反操作以保护它们"

msgid "Makes rust build up inside the crevices using the baked AO map"
msgstr "使锈在凹槽内积聚，使用烘焙的光照遮蔽图（AO 图）"

msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

msgid "Changes every random pattern of the effect"
msgstr "改变效果的每个随机图案"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

msgid "Show the fine tuning controls: grain, drip shape, gravity and the baked map influences"
msgstr "显示精细调节控件：颗粒、滴落形状、重力以及烘焙图的权重影响"

msgid "edge detail"
msgstr "边缘细节"

msgid "{cuantos} {'layer' if cuantos == 1 else 'layers'} stopped using it: {', '.join(desasignados[:4])}{'...' if cuantos > 4 else ''}"
msgstr "{cuantos} {'layer' if cuantos == 1 else 'layers'} 已停止使用它：{', '.join(desasignados[:4])}{'...' if cuantos > 4 else ''}"

msgid "Turn Edge Detail back on and assign it again to restore them"
msgstr "重新打开边缘细节并将其重新分配以恢复它们"

msgid "EdgeDetail"
msgstr "边缘细节"

msgid "Enable/Disable EdgeDetail"
msgstr "启用/禁用边缘细节"

msgid "UDIM Tile"
msgstr "UDIM 瓦片"

msgid "Node group {ghost_ng_name} could not be appended!."
msgstr "无法附加节点组 {ghost_ng_name}。"

msgid "Principled"
msgstr "Principled"

msgid "Resolution of the erode effect"
msgstr "腐蚀效果的分辨率"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Pixels to move the mask edge. Negative grows the mask, positive shrinks it. Measured at 1024 px, so changing the resolution does not change the result"
msgstr "移动遮罩边缘的像素数。负值扩大遮罩，正值缩小它。以 1024px 为基准测量，因此更改分辨率不会改变结果"

msgid "Softness"
msgstr "柔和度"

msgid "Blur applied after the edge has moved, in pixels at 1024. Erode rebuilds a hard edge, so this is how you get a soft one back. It softens the whole edge, and rounds corners as a side effect"
msgstr "在边缘移动后应用的模糊量，单位为 1024px 下的像素。腐蚀会重建硬边，这是您重新获得软边的方法。它会软化整个边缘，并作为副作用使角变圆"

msgid "Resolution of the highpass effect"
msgstr "高斯模糊效果分辨率"

msgid "Blur Strength"
msgstr "模糊强度"

msgid "Smoothing strength for the high-pass effect"
msgstr "高斯模糊效果的平滑度"

msgid "Contrast"
msgstr "对比度"

msgid "Factor to adjust the intensity of the HighPass"
msgstr "调整高斯模糊的强度因子"

msgid "Toggle Blur"
msgstr "切换模糊"

msgid "On"
msgstr "开"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

msgid "Resolution of the intelligent mask blur"
msgstr "智能蒙版模糊分辨率"

msgid "Layer ID"
msgstr "图层 ID"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "激活"

msgid "Previous Active State"
msgstr "之前的激活状态"

msgid "How deep or high this layer pushes. -1 and +1 are as far as an 8 or 16 bit file can go, because the map is written around mid grey. Type a larger number for an exaggerated relief: it needs a float format (EXR) to survive, and the bake will tell you if it does not fit the one you picked"
msgstr "此图层推入的深度或高度。-1 和 +1 是 8 位或 16 位文件能达到的最远/最高值，因为贴图是在中灰处生成的。输入更大的数值以产生夸张的浮雕效果：它需要浮点格式（EXR）才能保存，烘焙过程会告知您是否超出了所选格式的容量"

msgid "Factor"
msgstr "因子"

msgid "Tiling X"
msgstr "平铺 X 轴"

msgid "Lock Tiling"
msgstr "锁定平铺"

msgid "Resolution of LinkMask"
msgstr "链接遮罩分辨率"

msgid "Coverage"
msgstr "覆盖范围"

msgid "Bake this Link as a 0..1 coverage mask instead of the signed relief. Use it to colour or texture the WHOLE stitch: the signed signal only paints the raised half, because a negative mix Factor paints nothing. Add a second Link to the same effect if you need both"
msgstr "将此链接烘焙为 0..1 的覆盖遮罩，而不是有符号的浮雕效果。使用它来对整条缝进行着色或纹理贴图：因为有符号信号只会绘制凸起的一半（因为负混合因子不产生任何输出），所以如需同时实现两种效果，请添加第二个链接"

msgid "Resolution of the sharpen effect"
msgstr "锐化效果的分辨率"

msgid "Intensity of the sharpen effect (0 = no effect, 4 = maximum)"
msgstr "锐化效果强度（0=无效果，4=最大）"

msgid "Keep 8-bit"
msgstr "保留 8 位"

msgid "If enabled, does not convert the final result to float32"
msgstr "如果启用，则不将最终结果转换为 float32"

msgid "Resolution of the slopeblur effect"
msgstr "斜模糊效果的分辨率"

msgid "Generated Noise"
msgstr "生成的噪声"

msgid "Procedural Noise"
msgstr "程序噪声"

msgid "Custom Image"
msgstr "自定义图像"

msgid "Use a texture as slope map"
msgstr "使用纹理作为坡度图"

msgid "Texture"
msgstr "纹理"

msgid "Image to drive the slope blur"
msgstr "图像驱动斜向模糊"

msgid "Tiling / Scale"
msgstr "平铺 / 缩放"

msgid "Scales the generated noise or tiles the custom image"
msgstr "缩放生成的噪声或平铺自定义图像"

msgid "Use Slope Magnitude"
msgstr "使用斜率幅度"

msgid "If enabled, steep slopes will create stronger blur/warp. If disabled, all slopes force equal displacement."
msgstr "如果启用，陡峭的斜坡会产生更强的模糊/扭曲。如果禁用，所有斜坡强制产生相同的位移."

msgid "Linear (Fast)"
msgstr "线性（快速）"

msgid "Standard interpolation"
msgstr "标准插值"

msgid "Bicubic (Sharp)"
msgstr "双三次（锐利）"

msgid "Sharper results, slightly slower"
msgstr "更锐利的结果，稍慢一些"

msgid "Number of samples"
msgstr "采样数量"

msgid "Slope blur effect intensity"
msgstr "斜率模糊效果强度"

msgid "Blur Radius"
msgstr "模糊半径"

msgid "Radius for slope map blur"
msgstr "坡度图模糊的半径"

msgid "Random seed for noise generation"
msgstr "噪声生成的随机种子"

msgid "Slope Blur operation mode"
msgstr "坡度模糊操作模式"

msgid "Both (Blur)"
msgstr "两者（模糊）"

msgid "Standard directional blur"
msgstr "标准方向性模糊"

msgid "Inner (Erode)"
msgstr "内部（侵蚀）"

msgid "Minimum values"
msgstr "最小值"

msgid "Outer (Dilate)"
msgstr "外部（膨胀）"

msgid "Maximum values"
msgstr "最大值"

msgid "Smoothness applied per sample"
msgstr "每样本应用平滑度"

msgid "Include this stitch curve in the mask. Turning it off keeps the curve drawn and editable, it just stops stamping"
msgstr "将此缝合曲线包含在遮罩中。关闭它可保持曲线绘制和编辑，只是停止打样"

msgid "Active Stitch"
msgstr "活动缝合"

msgid "Active 2D Stitch"
msgstr "活动 2D 缝合"

msgid "Spacing"
msgstr "间距"

msgid "Distance between consecutive stitches, in centimeters"
msgstr "连续缝合之间的间距，单位为厘米"

msgid "Lock Size"
msgstr "锁定尺寸"

msgid "Keep width equal to length. Unlock to make stitches longer than they are wide"
msgstr "使宽度等于长度。取消锁定可使缝合比其宽更长"

msgid "Length"
msgstr "长度"

msgid "Length of each stitch along the curve, in centimeters"
msgstr "沿曲线的每条缝合的长度，单位为厘米"

msgid "Width of each stitch across the curve, in centimeters"
msgstr "每针在曲线上的宽度，单位为厘米"

msgid "Surface Offset"
msgstr "表面偏移"

msgid "Distance the curve is pushed away from the surface, in millimeters, to avoid z-fighting with the model while editing"
msgstr "曲线远离表面的距离（以毫米为单位），以避免在编辑时与模型发生 z-fighting 冲突"

msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "镜像"

msgid "Mirror every seam across the plane through the object pivot. The mirrored seam is projected onto the actual geometry of the other side, so it follows the model even where it is not perfectly symmetrical"
msgstr "将每条缝沿物体枢轴所在的平面进行镜像。镜像后的缝会投影到另一侧的实际几何体上，因此即使该区域不完全对称也会跟随模型变化"

msgid "No mirroring"
msgstr "不镜像"

msgid "Mirror across the local YZ plane"
msgstr "沿局部 YZ 平面对称镜像"

msgid "Mirror across the local XZ plane"
msgstr "沿局部 XZ 平面对称镜像"

msgid "Mirror across the local XY plane"
msgstr "沿局部 XY 平面对称镜像"

msgid "Curve Samples"
msgstr "曲线采样"

msgid "Samples taken along each curve segment, between two control points. Higher values follow the surface more closely between them and measure the curve length more precisely. It does not change how many stitches there are: that is the spacing. Every sample is a query against the mesh, so raising it slows down the live preview: worth it on a curve crossing heavy relief, wasted on a flat one"
msgstr "沿每条曲线段（两个控制点之间）采样的样本。较高的值会在它们之间更紧密地跟随曲面，并更精确地测量曲线长度。它不会改变针脚数量：那是间距决定的。每个样本都是对网格的查询，因此提高它会降低实时预览的性能：在穿过复杂曲面的曲线上值得这样做，但在平坦表面上则浪费资源"

msgid "UV tile this mask lives in"
msgstr "UV 平铺此遮罩所在的 UV 坐标"

msgid "Resolution of the stitches mask"
msgstr "针脚遮罩分辨率"

msgid "Stitch Texture"
msgstr "针脚纹理"

msgid "Texture stamped for each stitch. Luminance multiplied by alpha, so it works both with white-on-transparent and white-on-black textures"
msgstr "为每个针脚生成的贴图。亮度乘以透明度，因此它既适用于白底透明纹理，也适用于白底黑色纹理"

msgid "Mid Level"
msgstr "中间级别"

msgid "Grey level of the texture that counts as background and does not paint. 0 for a white-on-black texture, 0.5 for one baked over neutral grey. Above 0 the mask carries sign: use it only on Height or Displacement"
msgstr "被视为背景且不进行绘制的纹理灰度水平。0 表示白底黑纹理，0.5 表示覆盖中性灰色的纹理。高于 0 时遮罩带有符号：仅在高度或位移上使用"

msgid "Texture Rotation"
msgstr "纹理旋转"

msgid "Rotate the stitch texture inside its stamp. Use it when the texture is drawn across instead of along the seam. Quarter turns are lossless"
msgstr "在针脚印章内旋转针脚纹理。当纹理是沿接缝绘制而不是跨接缝绘制时使用它。四分之一转是无损的"

msgid "Edge falloff of the procedural stitch"
msgstr "程序化针脚的边缘衰减"

msgid "Auto Stitch"
msgstr "自动缝合"

msgid "Keep stitch curves generated along the UV seams of the model. Turning it off removes them, keeping the ones you drew by hand"
msgstr "沿模型 UV 接缝生成的缝合曲线。关闭后移除它们，保留您手动绘制的部分"

msgid "Seam UVs"
msgstr "接缝 UV"

msgid "UV map the automatic stitches are read from. Leave it empty to use the active one. Point it at a second unwrap made just for seams and the generated stitches land on the model as surface curves, so they bake correctly into the UVs you actually texture with"
msgstr "读取自动缝合曲线的 UV 映射。留空则使用当前激活的映射。指向专门为接缝制作的第二个展开图，则生成的缝合会作为表面曲线落在模型上，以便正确烘焙到您实际进行纹理化的 UV 中"

msgid "Sew"
msgstr "缝合"

msgid "Which island borders get stitched"
msgstr "缝合哪些岛屿边缘"

msgid "Seams, one side"
msgstr "接缝，单侧"

msgid "One row per seam of the model. A UV border whose geometry continues on another island is a seam; an open mesh border (a hem, a hole) is not"
msgstr "每条接缝一行。几何体延续到另一个岛屿的 UV 边缘是接缝；开放的网格边缘（如衣边、孔洞）则不是"

msgid "Seams, both sides"
msgstr "接缝，双侧"

msgid "Stitch both banks of every seam, so the row shows on each side of the cut"
msgstr "缝合每条接缝的两侧，使该行在切口两侧都显示"

msgid "Every UV border"
msgstr "每个 UV 边界"

msgid "Stitch the whole outline of every island, without telling seams from open mesh borders"
msgstr "缝合每个岛屿的整个轮廓，而不区分接缝与开放网格边缘"

msgid "Inset"
msgstr "内缩"

msgid "How far inside the island the generated stitches sit, as a fraction of the stitch width. Keeps them from bleeding into the neighbouring island"
msgstr "生成的缝线距离岛屿内部多远，以缝线宽度为比例。防止它们渗入相邻岛屿"

msgid "Min. Seam Length"
msgstr "最小接缝长度"

msgid "Seams shorter than this get no stitches, in centimeters. Useful to skip the little borders a UV unwrap leaves behind"
msgstr "比此更短的接缝将不生成缝线，单位为厘米。可用于跳过 UV 展开后留下的微小边缘"

msgid "Simplify"
msgstr "简化"

msgid "How far the generated curve may drift from the real border, in UV units. Higher values give fewer control points"
msgstr "生成的曲线可偏离真实边界多远，以 UV 单位计算。更高的值会减少控制点数量"

msgid "Curves"
msgstr "曲线"

msgid "Stitch Size"
msgstr "缝线大小"

msgid "Live Preview"
msgstr "实时预览"

msgid "Rasterize the stitches into the mask while drawing, instead of only when the stroke is released"
msgstr "绘制时将缝线栅格化到遮罩中，而不是仅在释放笔触时才进行栅格化"

msgid "Use Virtual Empty"
msgstr "使用虚拟空对象"

msgid "This element maps through a virtual projection box instead of an Empty object"
msgstr "该元素通过虚拟投影盒而非空对象进行映射"

msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

msgid "Position of the projection box, in world space"
msgstr "投影盒在世界空间中的位置"

msgid "Position of the projection box, relative to the object's origin"
msgstr "相对于对象原点的投影盒位置"

msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

msgid "Rotation of the projection box"
msgstr "投影盒的旋转"

msgid "Scale"
msgstr "缩放"

msgid "Size of the projection box"
msgstr "投影盒的大小"

msgid "Uniform Size"
msgstr "统一大小"

msgid "Keep the projection box cubic. Unlock it to size each axis on its own, which stretches the texture"
msgstr "保持投影盒为立方体。解锁它可单独设置每个轴，从而拉伸纹理"

msgid "Side of the projection box"
msgstr "投影盒的侧面"

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形状"

msgid "Box"
msgstr "立方体"

msgid "Cubic projection box, for triplanar and planar mapping"
msgstr "用于三平面和平面贴图"

msgid "Plane"
msgstr "平面"

msgid "Flat rectangle, for decals and text effects"
msgstr "扁平矩形，适用于贴纸和文字效果"

msgid "Snapped To"
msgstr "吸附到"

msgid "Object this projection box is stuck to. It follows the object's transform"
msgstr "该投影盒所附着的对象。它跟随对象的变换"

msgid "Rotation of the decal on the surface, around its own normal"
msgstr "在表面上，围绕其自身的法线旋转的贴纸"

