msgstr "空间"

msgid "Where this shape was drawn"
msgstr "绘制此形状的位置"

msgid "Surface"
msgstr "表面"

msgid "Drawn on the model, in the 3D viewport"
msgstr "在 3D 视图中于模型上绘制"

msgid "Drawn on the UV layout, in the 2D view"
msgstr "在 UV 布局中于 2D 视图绘制"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

msgid "How the shape is rasterized"
msgstr "形状的栅格化方式"

msgid "Filled"
msgstr "填充"

msgid "Closed shape, filled inside"
msgstr "封闭形状，填充内部"

msgid "Stroke"
msgstr "笔触"

msgid "Open stroke with a thickness"
msgstr "用粗细打开笔触"

msgid "Closed shape drawn as a ring, not filled"
msgstr "以环状绘制的封闭形状，未填充"

msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "How this shape combines with the ones below it in the stack"
msgstr "该形状如何与堆栈中下方的形状组合"

msgid "Union"
msgstr "联盟"

msgid "Add this shape to the ones below"
msgstr "将此形状添加到下方列表中的形状中"

msgid "Cut this shape out of the ones below"
msgstr "从下面的形状中切出这个形状"

msgid "Intersect"
msgstr "相交"

msgid "Keep only what is inside both. Clears everything outside this shape"
msgstr "保留同时位于两个形状内的内容。清除这两个形状之外的所有内容。"

msgid "Discard everything below and start from this shape"
msgstr "从此形状开始，丢弃其下方的所有内容"

msgid "Width of a stroke or of an outline ring, in centimeters. Filled shapes ignore it"
msgstr "描边或轮廓环的宽度（以厘米为单位）。填充的形状会忽略它"

msgid "Feather (cm)"
msgstr "羽化（厘米）"

msgid "Adds this much feather to every point of the shape, on top of what each point has from its own handle"
msgstr "为形状的每个点添加此数量的羽化效果，叠加在由该点的自身手柄产生的羽化效果之上"

msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "不透明度"

msgid "How much this shape contributes to the mask"
msgstr "此形状对遮罩的贡献程度"

msgid "Swap inside and outside. On a shape drawn over the model it picks the other side of the curve, which is the one you want about half the time"
msgstr "交换内部和外部。对于绘制在模型上方的形状，它会选择曲线的另一侧，这大约有一半的时间是您想要的结果"

msgid "Include this shape in the mask"
msgstr "将此形状包含在遮罩中"

msgid "Active Shape"
msgstr "活动形状"

msgid "Resolution of the vector mask"
msgstr "向量遮罩的分辨率"

msgid "Samples taken along each curve segment, between two control points. Higher values follow the outline more closely, at the cost of a slower live preview"
msgstr "每条曲线段（两个控制点之间）所取的采样数。较高的值会更紧密地跟随轮廓，但代价是实时预览较慢"

msgid "Default Thickness"
msgstr "默认粗细"

msgid "Thickness a newly drawn stroke starts with, in centimeters"
msgstr "新绘制的笔触起始时的粗细，单位为厘米"

msgid "Draw"
msgstr "绘制"

msgid "What a newly drawn shape will be. Every shape keeps its own type afterwards, so a filled shape and a stroke can live in the same mask"
msgstr "新绘制形状的类型。每个形状之后会保持其自己的类型，因此填充形状和笔触可以共存于同一个遮罩中"

msgid "How a newly drawn shape will combine with the ones already in the stack"
msgstr "与堆栈中已有的形状如何组合"

msgid "Add to what is already there"
msgstr "添加到已有的内容上"

msgid "Cut out of what is already there"
msgstr "从已有内容中挖空"

msgid "Keep only the overlap"
msgstr "仅保留重叠部分"

msgid "Discard everything below"
msgstr "丢弃以下所有内容"

msgid "Mirror every shape drawn on the MODEL across the plane through the object pivot. The mirrored shape is projected onto the actual geometry of the other side, so it follows the model even where it is not perfectly symmetrical. Shapes drawn on the UV layout are not mirrored: a UV island has no other half"
msgstr "将模型上绘制的所有形状沿通过对象枢轴点的平面进行镜像。镜像后的形状会投影到另一侧的实际几何体上，因此即使模型不完全对称也会跟随模型变化。在 UV 布局中绘制的形状不会被镜像：一个 UV 岛屿没有另一半。"

msgid "Feather Points"
msgstr "羽毛点"

msgid "Show the feather handle of each point, the one that sets how soft the edge is right there. Hide them to get them out of the way while shaping the outline"
msgstr "显示每个点的羽化手柄，即设置边缘柔度的那个。在塑造轮廓时隐藏它们以避开干扰。"

msgid "Rasterize into the mask while drawing, instead of only when the stroke is released"
msgstr "在绘制时将其栅格化到遮罩中，而不是仅在释放笔触时才进行栅格化"

msgid "Tangent"
msgstr "切线"

msgid "Keep handles tangent to the surface while dragging them, instead of only while Ctrl is held. With it on, Ctrl is what frees the drag"
msgstr "拖动手柄时，使其与表面相切，而不是仅在按住 Ctrl 时。开启后，Ctrl 键用于释放拖拽。"

