msgid "Separate the low objects of this material far enough that AO and Thickness rays cannot reach a neighbour, and bake all of them in a single pass per map. Only affects the Cycles maps: the From Multires passes are always baked per object"
msgstr ""
"将本材质的低模对象彼此分离足够远，使得 AO 和厚度光线无法到达相邻对象，并在每张图中一次性烘焙它们。仅影响 Cycles 贴图：From Multires 通道始终按每个对象单独烘焙。|||~|||在本材质中所有低模对象以单次遍历每张图的方式烘焙，并保持其原始位置。仅在集合中没有对象使用高模时可用，且仅影响 Cycles 贴图：From Multires 通道始终按每个对象单独烘焙。\n"
"\n"
"该集合被烘焙为一个合并后的对象，因此在此选项开启时 AO“仅限局部”功能会被禁用，因为它不再能隔离每个对象。如需对象互不遮挡彼此，请使用 Explode（分离）。|||~|||为每张投影贴图烘焙一个二次校正版本，以便后续通过遮罩画笔对角落和倒角处的畸变进行修复。\n"
"\n"
"会加倍投影贴图的烘焙时间。仅适用于使用高模的集合：若无高模，则不存在投影光线，也就没有畸变问题。|||~|||将 Ambient Occlusion 光线限制在正在烘焙的对象范围内，使其不受场景中其他对象的遮挡影响。\n"
"\n"
"若启用 Group（组），整个材质集将被烘焙为一个合并后的对象，此时“仅限局部”意味着整个集合，对象之间仍会相互遮挡。请关闭 Group 以恢复此功能，或使用 Explode 将对象分离，使光线无法到达相邻对象。|||~|||添加由 Multiresolution 修饰器（法线、位移和向量位移）烘焙的贴图到列表中。Viewport 级别用作低分辨率网格，Render 级别用作高分辨率网格。|||~|||边界\n"
"扩展层缓存和效果烘焙中岛屿边界的范围。此设置独立于导出选项。|||~|||无填充\n"
"填充\n"
"膨胀无限"

msgid ""
"Bake all the low objects of this material in a single pass per map, leaving them where they are. Only available when no object of the set uses a high poly, and only affects the Cycles maps: the From Multires passes are always baked per object.\n"
"\n"
"The set is baked as one joined object, so the AO \"Only Local\" option is disabled while this is on: it would no longer isolate each object. Use Explode instead if you need the objects not to occlude each other"
msgstr ""
"一次性烘焙该材质中所有低模对象，保留其原始位置。仅在集合中没有对象使用高模时可用，且仅影响 Cycles 贴图：多边形细分的贴图始终按单个对象烘焙。\n"
"\n"
"该集合被烘焙为一个合并后的对象，因此在此选项启用期间，“局部”遮蔽选项将处于禁用状态（它将不再隔离每个对象）。如需使对象互不遮挡彼此，请使用“分离”。"

msgid ""
"Bake a second, skew-corrected version of each projected map, so the skewing near corners and bevels can be fixed afterwards by painting a mask over the baked result.\n"
"\n"
"Doubles the bake time of the projected maps. Only affects sets that use a high poly: without one there are no projection rays and no skewing"
msgstr ""
"为每个投影贴图烘焙一个二次校正版本，以便之后可以通过在烘焙结果上绘制遮罩来修复角落和倒角处的畸变。\n"
"\n"
"将投影贴图的烘焙时间翻倍。仅影响使用高面数模型的集合；如果没有高面数模型，则没有投影射线，也就没有畸变。"

msgid ""
"Limit the Ambient Occlusion rays to the object being baked, so the rest of the scene does not cast occlusion on it.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot do that with Group enabled: the whole material set is baked as one joined object, so \"local\" means the entire set and the objects in it still occlude each other. Turn Group off to get it back, or use Explode, which separates the objects so that no ray can reach a neighbour"
msgstr ""
"限制环境光遮蔽射线仅烘焙该对象，使场景其余部分不再对其产生遮挡。\n"
"\n"
"启用组时无法做到这一点：整个材质集会被烘焙为一个合并的对象，因此“局部”指的是整个集合，集合内的对象仍然会相互遮挡。关闭组即可恢复此功能，或使用“分离”，将对象分开，这样就没有射线能到达相邻对象了。"

msgid "Add the maps baked from the Multiresolution modifier (Normals, Displacement and Vector Displacement) to the list. The Viewport level is used as the low resolution mesh and the Render level as the high one"
msgstr "将多分辨率修改器（法线、位移和向量位移）烘焙的贴图添加到列表中。视口级别用作低精度网格，渲染级别用作高精度网格。"

msgid "Boundaries"
msgstr "边界"

msgid "How far the island borders are extended in the layer caches and in the effect bakes. It is independent from the export setting"
msgstr "岛屿边界在图层缓存和效果烘焙中延伸的范围。它独立于导出设置。"

msgid "No Padding"
msgstr "无填充"

msgid "Padding"
msgstr "填充"

msgid "Dilatation Infinite"
msgstr "无限扩张"

msgid "Padding Size"
msgstr "填充大小"

msgid "How many PIXELS the island borders are extended by in the layer caches and in the effect bakes. Same meaning at any resolution and with either bake system"
msgstr "岛屿边界在图层缓存和效果烘焙中扩展了多少像素。在任何分辨率下，使用任何烘焙系统均具有相同含义。"

msgid "Bake Object"
msgstr "烘焙对象"

msgid "Include this object in map baking"
msgstr "将此对象包含在烘焙地图中"

msgid "Tile Number"
msgstr "编号"

msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

msgid "Write this UDIM tile to disk when exporting"
msgstr "导出时将此 UDIM 瓦片写入磁盘"

msgid "Resolution for this UDIM tile. 'From Material' uses the Resolution Size of the Set Material"
msgstr "此 UDIM 分区的分辨率。'从材质中获取'使用集合材质的分辨率大小"

msgid "From Material"
msgstr "从材质"

msgid "Use the Resolution Size of the Set Material"
msgstr "使用集合材质的分辨率大小"

msgid "Type of Bake"
msgstr "烘焙类型"

msgid "Selected"
msgstr "已选择"

msgid "Which baked map to derive the curvature from"
msgstr "从哪个烘焙贴图推导曲率"

msgid "Use the Normal Map, or fall back to World Space Normal when the Normal Map carries no high poly detail"
msgstr "使用法线贴图，或在法线贴图没有高模细节时回退到世界空间法线"

msgid "Tangent space normal map. Carries the high poly detail (bevels, bolts, panel lines) but not the shape of the low poly itself"
msgstr "切线空间法线贴图。携带高模细节（倒角、螺栓、面板线），但不包含低模本身的形状"

msgid "Carries the actual mesh shape. Use it when the detail lives in the geometry instead of in a baked high poly"
msgstr "携带实际的网格形状。当细节存在于几何体而非烘焙的高模时使用它"

msgid "How far around each texel the geometry is taken into account. It is what decides what counts as an edge: anything tighter than this radius saturates to white or black, anything rounder comes out as a proportional grey. A fraction of the model bounding box when Relative is on, meters when it is off"
msgstr "每个像素周围考虑几何体的范围。它决定了什么算作边缘：比此半径更紧密的会饱和为白色或黑色，更圆润的会以比例灰色显示。开启相对模式时为模型包围盒的比例，关闭时为米数"

msgid "Read the Sampling Radius as a fraction of the model bounding box instead of in meters, so the same value works on any model size. With it off, a radius smaller than one texel cannot be measured and the map comes out with no edges at all"
msgstr "将采样半径读作模型包围盒的比例而非米数，这样相同的值适用于任何模型尺寸。关闭时，小于一个像素的半径无法测量，贴图将完全没有边缘"

msgid "Normalize the map to its own content instead of using fixed bounds. Off by default: with it on, the same edge gets a different grey in every material, and each UDIM tile normalizes on its own, which shows up as seams between tiles"
msgstr "将贴图归一化为其自身内容而非使用固定范围。默认关闭：开启后，同样的边缘在不同材质中会得到不同的灰色，每个 UDIM 分块独立归一化，这会在分块之间显示为接缝"

msgid "Curvature value written as black. In units of sampling radius over edge radius"
msgstr "以黑色书写的曲率值。单位为采样半径与边缘半径之比"

msgid "Bounds Max"
msgstr "范围最大值"

msgid "Curvature value written as white. In units of sampling radius over edge radius"
msgstr "曲率值以白色显示。单位为采样半径除以边缘半径"

msgid "Contrast of the curvature around neutral grey. Higher values make edges and cavities stand out more. Measured against Substance on the same model, 1.0 is what puts our map next to theirs"
msgstr "围绕中性灰色的曲率对比度。较高的值会使边缘和凹陷更加突出。与同一模型上的 Substance 相比，1.0 是使我们的贴图与其接近的值"

msgid "Levels of the multi-scale pyramid baked into the map itself. 1 keeps only the finest scale, which is what the Curvature mask wants: it already accumulates the wider scales on its own, and leaving them baked in here counts them twice and widens every edge"
msgstr "将多尺度金字塔的级别烘焙到贴图本身中。设置为 1 仅保留最精细的尺度，这正是曲率遮罩想要的：它已经自行累积了更宽的尺度，而在这里将它们烘焙进去会使它们重复计数并加宽每条边缘"

msgid "Smooths the normal field before differentiating it. Too much of it widens thin edges and lowers their peak, which is what small detail lives on. Raise it if the bake comes out speckled, lower it to keep fine detail"
msgstr "在微分之前平滑法线场。过多会加细窄边缘并降低其峰值，而这正是微小细节赖以生存的地方。如果烘焙结果出现斑点，则调高它；若要保留精细细节，则调低它"

msgid "Removes the broad curvature of the object by subtracting a local average. Off by default: it flattens wide bevels to grey and rings every bright edge with a dark halo. Flat areas already sit on neutral grey without it. Raise it only to force a very uniform grey on a heavily curved model"
msgstr "通过减去局部平均值来移除对象的整体曲率。默认关闭：它会压平宽倒角使其变为灰色，并为每个亮边缘添加深色光晕。平坦区域本身已位于中性灰色上，无需此选项。仅在需要对高度弯曲的模型强制施加非常均匀的灰色时才调高它"

msgid "Edge Radius"
msgstr "边缘半径"

msgid "Bevel radius of the Edge pass. A fraction of the model bounding box when Relative is on, meters when it is off. Low values give the thin crisp lines the curvature needs; the value written into the Bevel node is this one resolved to meters, so it adapts to the scale of the model on its own"
msgstr "边缘通道的倒角半径。当“相对”开启时为模型包围盒的比例，关闭时为米。低值可为细窄清晰的线条提供所需的曲率；写入倒角节点的值为该值解析为米，因此它能自动适应模型的尺度"

msgid "Read the Edge Radius as a fraction of the model bounding box instead of in meters, so the same value works on any model size without having to retune it"
msgstr "将边缘半径读作模型包围盒的分数而非以米为单位，这样相同的值即可在任何模型尺寸上工作而无需重新调整"

